WEBVTT

00:24:59.700 --> 00:25:03.586
CM: I am convinced that the internet
is going to change everything

00:25:03.610 --> 00:25:07.176
about how knowledge
organizations do their work.

00:25:07.200 --> 00:25:09.306
And I think it will be very important

00:25:09.330 --> 00:25:11.216
for the CIA to figure out

00:25:11.240 --> 00:25:14.556
how they're going to adapt
to digital technology.

00:25:14.580 --> 00:25:17.266
I just thought that, you
know, the oceans would part

00:25:17.290 --> 00:25:20.406
and people would recognize
the wisdom of what I was saying,

00:25:20.430 --> 00:25:24.876
but all I got was resistance
and kind of evil stares.

00:25:24.900 --> 00:25:27.606
The internet was about open information

00:25:27.630 --> 00:25:29.446
and sharing information

00:25:29.470 --> 00:25:32.612
and making information freely available.